# Copy to `.env.local` at the repo root (Next.js loads it for `npm run dev` / `npm run build`).
# Recruiter assistant chat in the browser — must match your API (local dev server or Lambda URL).
# Optional during `next dev` (defaults to http://127.0.0.1:3001); required for production static export builds.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_RECRUITER_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3001

# Recruiter Playwright E2E ports and stack URLs: copy `.env.test.example` → `.env.test`.
